{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Peter's Graduation", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "I Believed in Me", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 13, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.   Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Simple Past tense versus  Past Continuous tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished.<br /> You use the Past Continuous to talk about events or actions that were happening at a time in the past.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular.<br />  Regular verbs end in <span class=\"italic\"> -ed</span> or <span class=\"italic\"> -ied</span>.<br /> Irregular verbs change in different ways.<br /> For questions in the past, you use the auxiliary did followed by the verb in the base form, like <span class=\"italic\"> Did</span> you ask \u2026 ?<br /> <span class=\"italic\"> Did</span> is the past form of <span class=\"italic\"> to do</span>.<br /><br />  For Past Continuous, we add <span class=\"italic\"> was/were + verb \u2013ing</span> to verbs.<br /> Some verbs need a change to the last letter to add <span class=\"italic\"> ing</span>.<br /> <br />  Some verbs like <span class=\"italic\">want </span>and <span class=\"italic\">know </span> are stative and do not use a Continous tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":9,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Present </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Past</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Past Continuous </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" talk\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" talked\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were talking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"think\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"thought\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were thinking \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"finish\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"finished\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were finishing \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"plan\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"planned\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were planning \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"start out \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"started out\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were starting out \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"put together \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" put together \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were putting together \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"know \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"knew \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"---\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"want\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"wanted\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"---\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "They were hoping to open a hotel when the time was right.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She was putting together a second book when the first one was published. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I thought I could put together a cookbook.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "future", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the time ahead", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What is in your future? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le13ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about the future.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "cookbook", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a text with recipes for cooking food", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to write a cookbook. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le13ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "editor", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who corrects texts", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You need an editor to look at your book.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le13ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "publisher", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person or company that puts out books ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You'll need a publisher for your cookbook. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le13ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "incredibly", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very; hard to believe", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It was incredibly difficult to do.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le13ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to put together", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to assemble ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can you put an outfit together for me? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le13ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn5le13ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Yesterday a spaceship landed in your city at 3 p.m.!", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write sentences saying what 5 people you know were doing when the spaceship landed.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use the Simple Past, Past Continuous and connectors.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your sentences to a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write 5 sentences saying what people were doing when something else happened. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use connectors.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my sentences to a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le13ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le13ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I was thinking about the future yesterday while I was working.  I was talking with some of the other chefs after we finished our shift. Most said they were planning to work at a hotel or cafe when they were done. <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: Were you planning to do the same thing?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No, I always wanted to have my own place."}, {"image": "engenn5le13ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "16500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: You mean opening a restaurant?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Maybe a small place to begin. I also thought I could put together a cookbook. <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: That sounds great. You'd need an editor and a publisher or web designer.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hmmm. I'll have to think about that. What were you planning on doing?"}, {"image": "engenn5le13ob02re2img06.jpg", "time": "33000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: When I started out, I wanted to run a company. After I saw how many hours my bosses at MechaTech put in, I changed my mind. They worked incredibly long hours. It never stopped.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Planning for the future was easier when it was farther away!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: I know exactly what you mean!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le13ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le13ob02re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk or report about actions, events or people. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can say what I was doing when something else happened.   ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What courses are you taking now?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Why did you choose those  courses?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What plans do you have for your future?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "How are you preparing to make your plans happen? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " What will the future bring?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "  Vanessa and Peter are discussing <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">the future</span>!", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents":